WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:36.400
<b>#8  All Together!</b>

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.360
I-I'm breaking away!

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:54.890
Thanks for your help until now!

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:56.220
Take care!

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.850
<i>It's finally my turn. Here we go.</i>

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:09.730
<i>The beginner class of the Minami Kamakura 
Night Criterium is reaching its climax.</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.020
With two laps remaining,

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.110
<i>the cosplay club's
Mr. Bear is still in the lead.</i>

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.950
<i>A group of first-years centered around 
the cycling club is following behind.</i>

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.450
And behind them

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.700
<i>is a mixed group of second and third-years.</i>

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:29.480
<i>The first-year pack appears to 
be attempting to catch up by</i>

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.550
<i>having riders pull until they're 
exhausted and break away.</i>

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:37.050
<i>How many of these riders will 
be able to catch up to Mr. Bear?</i>

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:41.840
<i>Break here and and head towards the light.</i>

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.250
<i>And turn!</i>

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.430
<i>Pedal as hard as you can 
until the next corner.</i>

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.590
Fuyune-san?

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.730
My leg is cramping!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:56.440
What?

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.070
A-Are you okay?

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.030
Sorry. It really hurts...

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.490
Fuyune-san, thank you. You can fall back.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.660
You two, follow me.

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:10.100
But we can't just leave Fuyune-chan.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.850
Don't worry about me. Just go, Hiromi.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.170
Fuyune-chan...

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.390
The rest is up to you.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.630
Okay. I'll ride.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.510
I'll ride as hard as I 
can for your sake, too.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:24.850
Let's go.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:28.890
You can do it.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.440
<i>The air resistance...</i>

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.730
<i>The sound of the wind is different.</i>

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.990
<i>This is what it's like to lead.</i>

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:49.200
<i>I had no idea it felt so lonely 
to have no one in front of you.</i>

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:52.490
Akizuki-san, are you okay?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.000
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.960
It's my turn to do my best now.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.550
Let's go, you two! Keep up!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:05.470
I see.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:10.000
They're maintaining their speed by 
having their leaders break away.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.190
This isn't good.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:13.940
If they pull any farther ahead, 
we won't be able to catch up.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.310
Go, Hiroko.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:15.810
What?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.480
I'll block the third-years.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.070
You go after the bicycle club.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:21.870
Mikako...

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.270
There's no time to talk.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:25.570
It's now or never.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.770
Okay, I'm taking this path!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.750
Farewell, Mikako!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.380
Go!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:35.810
Now, then...

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.730
Light swimming club first-year Sugita!

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:39.550
Ah! Yes, captain?

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:43.050
I have another job for you.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.430
The race has begun moving at

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.160
<i>dizzying speeds!</i>

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:50.880
<i>The three members of the cycling club are 
in hot pursuit of Mr. Bear at the front.</i>

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:54.640
<i>Second-year Azuma-san has 
also begun her attack.</i>

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:56.350
Meanwhile, the third-years'

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.110
<i>path is blocked by riders
who have fallen back.</i>

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:02.070
<i>They're unable to chase after 
the riders in front of them.</i>

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.610
Does that not count as interference?

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:11.700
Leading the pack and controlling its 
pace is standard practice in bike races.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.900
Really? Which means...

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:15.720
That's right.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:21.650
The fight for first has come down to
Mr. Bear, Azuma-san, and the bicycle club.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:28.070
<i>I can't keep going...</i>

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.830
Hiromi, Natsumi-san...

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.040
The rest is up to you!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.020
Akizuki-san...

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.100
Good work.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.920
Thanks, Tomo-chan.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.780
Good luck, you two!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.580
Maiharu-san, are you still okay?

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.730
I'm fine.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.380
Everyone else made things easier for us.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.200
I'm ready to go.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:49.830
You're right.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:56.940
For the others, we should overtake 
Mr. Bear and place first!

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:57.700
Yeah!

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:06.720
Ouch... Talk about pathetic.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.680
I have a fantastic bike, 
but my body can't keep up.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.040
I wasn't that useful.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.140
That's not true.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:21.150
Hiromi and Natsumi-san are going after 
the lead rider now, thanks to you.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.550
Akizuki-san...

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:25.570
Besides, I couldn't even keep 
trying until my legs cramped up.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.760
What are you talking about?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.530
Your leadership was truly impressive.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.300
We can take it slow.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:34.530
Let's head for the finish line, too.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.580
You're right.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.120
Cherry blossoms?

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:41.450
There's still a cherry tree
blooming somewhere.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:49.170
<i>The pain is getting worse.</i>

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.510
Natsumi-chan!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.220
Azuma-senpai is right behind us!

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:55.520
I know.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.600
But once we make it through
this turn, it's a straight line.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.560
We have an advantage,
since we're riding as a pair.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.480
What's this? Has riding alone 
finally caught up to him?

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:09.960
<i>Mr. Bear isn't riding with 
the same intensity anymore.</i>

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:13.230
<i>The gap between him and the 
bicycle club is closing.</i>

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.830
<i>Mr. Bear appears to be struggling.</i>

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:18.830
<i>They've made it through the 
gate and into the final lap.</i>

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.100
The final lap!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.340
Go for it!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.960
You can do it!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.790
Maiharu-san, let's catch up to Mr. Bear.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:26.920
Follow me!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:27.710
Got it!

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:31.430
<i>A little longer...</i>

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.390
<i>I just have to endure it a little longer.</i>

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.680
<i>The cycling club duo has finally 
caught up to the front.</i>

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.600
<i>Will they be able to overtake him?</i>

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.460
Maiharu-san, on the right!

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.190
Okay!

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:46.230
Bear?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.730
Bear!

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:50.490
Bear?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:56.070
Bear!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.450
They're good!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:01.000
Your students are learning, Sis.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.660
Bear!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.940
<i>Higa-san and Maiharu-san 
have taken the lead and</i>

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.960
Bear! Bear, Bear! Bear!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.960
<i>are widening the gap between 
themselves and Mr. Bear.</i>

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.880
Maiharu-san, sorry. This is as far as I go.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.420
Natsumi-chan, is it your shoulder?

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.890
I'm okay. Don't worry about me.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:21.790
I'll make it to the finish line,
and then I'll go home.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.810
So go. It's the final lap.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.940
Ride for the others, Maiharu-san!

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.950
Got it, Natsumi-chan.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.820
The others carried me this far.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:40.000
From here on out, I'll do what I can!

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:44.020
<i>Maiharu-san is charging ahead by herself.</i>

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.670
<i>Is this her final spurt?</i>

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.840
<i>There's a 180-degree turn 
right in front of her.</i>

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.170
What I can do...

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:58.050
No, the thing that only I can do 
right now is... ride as hard as I can!

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.350
<i>There's a turn here.</i>

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:04.460
<i>What's the right course? 
When do I use my brakes?</i>

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.350
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.110
<i>How have I been doing it until now?</i>

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.860
<i>I forgot!</i>

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.700
<i>Brake at the light on the right.</i>

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.030
<i>What?</i>

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.090
<i>Don't be scared, Hiromi.</i>

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:24.290
Okay.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.950
<i>It's time to accelerate.</i>

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.010
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.220
Tomo-chan, Fuyune-chan, Natsumi-chan...

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.140
Thanks, everyone.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.430
Let's go together!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:51.330
<i>The lead riders have rounded the martial 
arts gym and entered the final straight.</i>

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:57.440
<i>Who will be the first to race down 
this straight and through the goal gate?</i>

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:00.910
My legs...

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.330
How far behind is Mr. Bear?

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.420
Thanks, Mr. Bear!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:05.790
Bear?

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:08.790
Azuma-senpai?

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:13.320
His giant body makes him 
perfect for blocking the wind.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:15.740
Thanks to him, I'm fully charged.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:19.680
Let's go, Bicycle Club Member Maiharu Hiromi!

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:24.840
Let's enjoy the final straight.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.770
Okay. I will have fun.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:29.770
Bring it on.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:37.240
Bear, Bear, Bear!

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.200
<i>Twenty meters to the finish line!</i>

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.780
Go!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.490
<i>Ten meters!</i>

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:10.300
<i>Goal!</i>

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:20.240
<i>Goal!</i>

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:26.330
<i>The beginner class race of the first 
Minami Kamakura Night Criterium is over!</i>

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.860
<i>And the winner of this fierce battle is...</i>

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:37.170
<i>Maiharu Hiromi-san of the Minami 
Kamakura High School bicycle club!</i>

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.170
You did it, Hiromi.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:43.470
You did it.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.010
We won.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.020
Well done.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.010
Congratulations.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:52.070
I couldn't catch up to her in the end.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:54.520
How did she accelerate like 
that at the last second?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.440
Bear...

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.900
For the winner of the race, 
we have an extravagant prize.

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.860
<i>That prize is...</i>

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:06.430
Congratulations, Maiharu-san.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.240
<i>A road bike frame!</i>

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:10.660
What?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.840
This is a road bike?

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:18.820
I-It's so cute.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:37.110
Huh? Whoa...

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:41.370
Kamakura has a lot of lights.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:45.030
Hey, is that the Enoshima lighthouse?

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:48.530
Wow, horsey. Are we going to cross the ocean?

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:55.410
Just kidding. There's no way.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.340
This must be a dream.

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.570
You might be right.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.750
You can talk?

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:04.550
Of course I can.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:07.750
Then I am dreaming.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:12.970
Does that mean me placing first was also...

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.390
That was real.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.660
What?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.670
You did place first.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:23.780
But you didn't do it alone. Look.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.700
Hiromi!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.750
Girls...

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:32.960
You won first place with those girls.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.570
Don't forget that.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:37.580
Of course.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.860
It's so big!

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:56.340
You're right. The world is big, 
but together, we can go anywhere.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:58.310
Anywhere in the world?

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.570
That's right. As long as you 
keep wishing to go places.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:09.140
We can cross ridges, mountains, rivers,
and even the ocean to travel far, far away.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:13.340
I'm sure we'll find delicious things there.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:16.300
What? Delicious things?

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.240
Don't let go!

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:17.790
What?

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:28.980
Hiromi?

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.890
What are you doing?

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.130
You'll drown if you sleep in here.

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:39.390
You must still be tired from yesterday.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.650
You should wash away your exhaustion here.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:47.100
<i>Oh, it was a dream.</i>

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:49.070
<b>Minami Kamakura Hospital</b>

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.330
And done.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.780
Thank you.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:15:00.300
To be safe, try not to move 
it too much for a week.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:02.420
Okay.

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:06.630
You can ride your bike, but be 
careful not to hurt yourself.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:12.340
Okay, Maiharu-san's ma—I mean, Mom.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.670
Thank you.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.380
Oh, it's you.

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.020
What? Who, me?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.270
You must be Higa Natsumi-san.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.740
Um, have we met?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.450
Look at this.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.870
What? Is that...

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.940
The modern world is full of conveniences.

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:39.310
I can watch what you did 
yesterday with this.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.480
I see.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.420
I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.130
I'm Kamikura Rei.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.090
Kamikura? You mean...

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:52.260
Yes, I'm Fuyune's sister.

00:15:56.340 --> 00:16:01.020
Until recently, I couldn't even 
imagine Fuyune riding a bike.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.040
Really?

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:07.730
She's the type of girl to complain her 
leg is cramping after just a short walk.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.240
You're right.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:11.570
But...

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:19.290
She asked me if there was anything I 
wanted while I was staying in the hospital.

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:26.750
So I asked her to show me a sight 
she went to see on her own two legs.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.590
Her own two legs? So she 
decided to ride bicycles?

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.780
That's probably why she started.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:37.860
She keeps a camera on her because she's 
accommodating my selfishness, too.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:42.770
So I hope you'll keep being 
friends with Fuyune, Higa-san.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.980
Uh... I will! I'm looking forward to it, too.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:52.940
She can be reckless and a
sore loser, but she's a good girl.

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.230
Are you okay, Fuyune-chan?

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.330
Is it a post-bath chill?

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:02.120
No. Maybe someone's talking about me.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.200
It's Mr. Bear from yesterday.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:11.850
Come to think of it,
he's in the cosplay club, right?

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:15.930
What does it mean that 
they're resuming activity?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:21.060
<b>Resuming
Activity!!</b>

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:21.060
<b>Looking For
Members!!</b>

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.100
Apparently, the cosplay club

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.560
participated in an event shortly 
after the entrance ceremony.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:26.920
But they incurred my grandmother's wrath 
because the costumes they wore were

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:29.270
too revealing for high school students.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.230
Because of that, they were forbidden 
from attending events outside

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.160
the school for three months.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.560
But this bear was in the race, right?

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:39.910
You're right. He ended up placing third,

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.470
but until the third lap, he was 
in the lead the whole time,

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:55.260
<b>Resuming
Activity!!</b>

