00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:45.170
so he won a special award for fighting spirit.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:50.630
Their suspension was shortened, 
so they resumed activity today.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.710
Really?

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.990
That's great news, Mr. Bear.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.030
It sure is raining hard.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.860
The bicycle club can't do 
anything while it's raining.

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:09.350
I guess we should go home today.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:14.400
Anyway, the rain did come on suddenly.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:18.000
It started pouring the moment 
we crossed the finish line.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:21.660
Because of the rain, the intermediate 
and advanced class races were canceled.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:26.340
Shiki-sensei wanted to win so badly, too.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:28.280
She was pretty disappointed.

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:30.630
Did she want to race that much?

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.280
Of course she did.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:37.380
I'm not so sure. Maybe she 
just wanted the prize.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.150
Are you okay, Sis?

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.860
Did you catch a cold?

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:46.220
No... Maybe someone's talking about me.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:49.160
Anyway, that was disappointing.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:52.080
I can't believe it started raining then.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.370
I know.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:58.640
My class's prize was supposed 
to be a set of new components.

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:00.880
If only you won those.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:02.690
You can still get them.

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:08.250
You want the parts beside 
the frame for free, right?

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:14.670
I'll ask the regulars at my store 
for parts they don't need anymore.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.580
Are you sure?

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:21.550
Yeah, they all buy the newest 
parts when they come out.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:25.400
They should have plenty of leftover 
parts that aren't too old.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.140
Thanks, manager.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.800
No need to thank me.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:34.270
I'd been wanting to give Maiharu-chan 
a swift steed to ride, too.

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:41.300
After all, this is the only frame 
the choosy Maiharu-chan liked.

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:45.960
I can't believe she won this frame.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:48.130
She's a lucky girl.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.780
Listen, you two.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:54.690
Don't tell Maiharu-chan I'm 
putting this bike together.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:56.080
We know.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:58.500
It's going to be a surprise, right?

00:19:59.070 --> 00:19:59.840
That's right.

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:03.940
I'm already excited to see 
the surprise on her face.

